SUMMARY:Splat Space Community Biolab meetup
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nWe will meet to discuss in
 dividual or group research projects\, logistics of our bio space at SplatS
 pace\, or developments in biology. Attendees are encouraged to lead a disc
 ussion on any of these topics. Non-Splat members are welcome.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/313911421/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260323T151321Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260323T151321Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_315521403@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042457Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260722T200000
SUMMARY:Woodshop Wednesdays
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nWhat is Wood-shop Wednesda
 y? Well its basically an open house for the Splat Space Wood-shop.\n\nHave
  a project you need help with? Want to learn how to safely use the wood sh
 op equipment? Just want to hang out and talk shop? Come on by. Each week o
 ne or more of our more knowledgeable wood workers will be there to help. N
 o need to sign up.\n\nNot a Splat Space member?\nWell you are also welcome
  to join us\, but unfortunately because of insurance limitation\, you cann
 ot use the equipment.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you all there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/315521403/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260702T215458Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260702T215458Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Splat Space (Durham Hackerspace)
UID:event_315560110@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260719T042457Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260725T160000
SUMMARY:Open House
DESCRIPTION:Splat Space - Durham's Hackerspace\nEvery Saturday between 1pm
  to 4pm we open our doors to the public to give anyone who wants to stop b
 y a chance to see our space. It's a chance for prospective new members to 
 take a tour of our space and ask any questions they have about what we off
 er.\n\nFeel free to come by or contact us if you want to schedule a tour.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/splatspace/events/315560110/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260705T172507Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260705T172507Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
